```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "mint this hearth's own invite at the current epoch; nothing kept"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.invite.mints", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.invite.mints"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.invite.mints"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.invite.mints ~ invite ~ one string to carry

`lares host invite` mints this hearth's own invite at the current epoch (`--nexus <aid>`, else this hearth's own charter; `--relay <ws-url>` names the relay it dials) and prints the one string to carry to one newcomer; it redeems once, at this hearth's own gate, and nothing about it stays here.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ invite · relayed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`invite` params=`~ mint an invite on this hearth's own charter`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`relayed` params=`nexus/<aid> relay/wss://relay.example ~ mint one naming a relay`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nexus · relay

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus to act in; absent, this hearth's own charter`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`relay` params=`takes/ws-url ~ the relay the invite names`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ custody

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`custody` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ one sealed act frame on the custody door under the vessel key; the hosting state never rests in the clear`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ refused · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the custody door refused the act; the message names why`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the act failed outside the door's refusals`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ minted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`minted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[nexusAid epoch invite via]] ~ the invite string`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares host invite

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares host invite]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

